Description: add CIX Sky1 V4L2M2M codec support
 Add AV1 decoding, VP9 encoding, AV1F/AV01 format matching, the Sky1
 multi-plane frame copy fix, and correct encoded packet sizes when the
 driver reports a non-zero data_offset. Automatic decoder selection is omitted.
Author: Sky1-Linux contributors
Origin: https://github.com/Sky1-Linux/ffmpeg-sky1
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-09-18

